cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use UCIP or its dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "UCIP: Urban Climate Intelligence Platform"
abstract: >-
  A decision-support platform for ward-level heat vulnerability in Mumbai. UCIP
  computes a Heat Vulnerability Index over a 1 km grid from satellite land
  surface temperature, vegetation, land cover and demographic data, rolls it up
  to the 24 BMC wards with literature-derived PCA weights, and recommends
  nature-based cooling interventions through an ecological plantability filter.
  Every weight, dataset, assumption and limitation is published alongside the
  output.
